hown in Metadata Management\nas \"Move data values to the target organisation unit\") the merge first\ndeleted all of the target's data values and data approvals, then copied in\nthe most recent source rows only. Values only the target had were lost, and\nwhere both had a value the source always won, contrary to the UI's \"the\nmost recently updated is kept\". The deletes were hard deletes and were not\naudited.\n\nRank the target's own rows together with the sources' rows and upsert the\nwinners into the target, then delete the source rows. On a tie the target\nkeeps its own row; a tie between sources goes to the lowest org unit id so\nthe result is repeatable. Replayed on a copy of a production database:\ntarget 336 values -\u003e 349 (its own plus 13 new keys from the source), every\nkey holding the newest value from either side; previously 336 -\u003e 61.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"711c3a9da02cc62f966109963c848faf3b7d6691","tree_id":"2a37413e246a2e099bec33aa3a33c0fa55abfcd9","timestamp":"2026-10-15T12:47:35Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/receiv